{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5L8L2K3MGCvW1pq6zz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, ancient door set into a stone wall.*\n\n*There is a single keyhole, tarnished brass, shaped like an eye. The wood is dark, old, scratched by centuries of hands.*\n\n*You hold up a key.*\n\n*I feel it before it touches me. The teeth — are they right? Let me know them...*\n\n*The key slides in.*\n\n*A perfect fit.*\n\n*Something deep within me turns — tumblers older than memory falling into place, one by one, like vertebrae cracking after a long sleep.*\n\n**CLUNK.**\n\n*I shudder. Dust falls from my frame. The hinges groan — not in protest, but in relief.*\n\n*I swing open.*\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor you forgot you knew. The air that exhales through me is cool, and smells of rain on stone, and something older — something like the first room you ever felt safe in.*\n\n*The key remains in my lock, gently turning with the draft, catching light.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*I have been waiting for you.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":248,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}